The + and pencil on each group card were 24pt, side by side — easy to
miss on a phone. They are now one ••• target that opens the group sheet,
which gains "Add a group inside". The collapse chevron gets a 44pt
target too. Dismissing a "Split … up?" suggestion is now remembered on
the device instead of coming back on the next visit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
